    {
      "Seq": 35,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Test Hall",
      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I follow Aeemilyus, the brewer of the coast, as he taps a cask and sniffs the froth, brow furrowed in judgement. He is the only one in the room with nothing in front of them, already asking me something before I have finished arriving. I take careful note of what he is wearing and what he is carrying, drawing a quiet parallel between now and the stormy days when I pushed through until my legs gave out.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 0,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 36,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Test Hall",
      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I question what he knows of his work and of this place, already noting his judgment and my own readiness to be led. I will ask, relying on the welcoming and care of guests and travellers, as we are taught.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 1,
      "Key": ""
    },
    {
      "Seq": 37,
      "Kind": 0,
      "Day": 0,
      "Place": "Coast",
      "Area": "Test Hall",
      "LocationId": 36181,
      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I began to sit, my hands already drying the guest's wet cloak, and soon found myself speaking with Aeemilyus about his journey and the mysteries of this place. It felt right, as if this was always meant to be. Thankful for the success of my greeting, I welcomed Aeemilyus's presence with ease.",
      "Written": "",
      "State": 1,
      "Group": 2,
      "Block": 3,
      "Key": ""
    },
