      "Actor": "Ernaeulht the White",
      "ByCompanion": false,
      "Source": "I follow Aeemilyus, the brewer of the coast, as he taps a cask and sniffs the froth, brow furrowed in judgement. He is the only one in the room with nothing in front of them, already asking me something before I have finished arriving. I take careful note of what he is wearing and what he is carrying, recalling my own experience of being observed at the orphanage.",
